  "description": "The dependency-free half of the ADP.Darlastic identity-resolution engine: scoring, normalization (transliteration, mojibake recovery, name skeletons), clustering with name-chain survivorship, case categorisation, and the scorer's own explain trace. No SQL Server, no Cosmos — so a serving surface can compute a pair's score and derivation at read time without taking a storage dependency.",
